     $$ B_k = BP(R_{HR}^{detach}) $$
 4.  **Blurring:** Convolve the original high-resolution rendered image $R_{HR}$ with the predicted kernels $B_k$ to produce the blurred reference image $R_{HR}^{blur}$:
