 ## Subtopics
 
 ### View Consistency Refinement
-This variant refines the appearance injected by SwinIR (which constructs mipmap independently per image) within the 3D model to ensure view-consistency [S2]. The process involves: 1. Using SwinIR to construct mipmap independently for each image without scene-level fine-tuning; 2. Refining the injected appearance within the 3D model [S2].
